abstract: >-
  Vendor-neutral pre-production assurance lab for AI agents operating around SAP and
  enterprise systems of record. SAO combines an executable 51-case benchmark,
  machine-readable decision/evidence/state-change contracts, deterministic control
  baselines, a stateful synthetic enterprise simulator with fault injection, runtime-neutral
  adapters, reproducible experiment provenance, and integrity manifests. It evaluates
  identity, authority, evidence, policy, capability, approval, stale-state safety,
  idempotency, tool misuse, memory trust, provenance, postconditions, audit, and compensation.
